</run><run fontsize='11'>8.01 revalidation, 8.02 human checkpoints, 8.03 refinement: 6 Internal controls</run><run>Æ&#10;</run><run fontsize='11'>9 / 10.02 configuration: 7 Configuration</run><run>Æ&#10;</run><run fontsize='11' fontstyle="italic">Not shown, no data yet: audit results (error rates found by auditors), contract status, concurrent review.</run><run>Æ&#10;</run></formatted-text></zone></zone></zones><simple-id uuid='{072F2F7D-CE18-5CE6-92C5-1E2AD5E2E273}' /></dashboard><dashboard name="1 Weekly sample"><style /><size maxheight='1000' maxwidth='1600' minheight='1000' minwidth='1600' /><zones><zone h='100000' id='3' type='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'><zone h='7000' id='4' type='text' w='100000' x='0' y='0'><formatted-text><run fontsize='18' fontstyle='bold'>1 Weekly sample</run><run>Æ&#10;</run><run fontsize='10'>Requirements 4.01 and 4.03: the cases COMO audits this week</run></formatted-text></zone><zone h='23250' id='5' name="KPI Selected" w='16800' x='16000' y='7000' /><zone h='23250' id='6' name="KPI Vs Target" w='16800' x='32800' y='7000' /><zone h='23250' id='7' name="KPI Clinical" w='16800' x='49600' y='7000' /><zone h='23250' id='8' name="KPI Expedited" w='16800' x='66400' y='7000' /><zone h='23250' id='9' name="KPI OON" w='16800' x='83200' y='7000' /><zone h='23250' id='10' name="Sample by area" w='42000' x='16000' y='30250' /><zone h='23250' id='11' name="Target vs selected" w='42000' x='58000' y='30250' /><zone h='23250' id='12' name="Determination mix" w='42000' x='16000' y='53500' /><zone h='23250' id='13' name="OON by area" w='42000' x='58000' y='53500' /><zone h='23250' id='14' name="Case list" w='84000' x='16000' y='76750' /><zone h='9000' id='15' mode='dropdown' name="KPI Selected" param='[federated.v_smpl_dsh_sample].[none:SMPL_RUN_KEY:nk]' type='filter' w='16000' x='0' y='7000' /><zone h='9000' id='16' mode='dropdown' name="Target vs selected" param='[federated.v_smpl_dsh_run_stat].[none:Run_Key:nk]' type='filter' w='16000' x='0